    "# 🚀 Day 11: Final Comprehensive Validation Across All Versions (v1–v4 & RAG)\n",
    "### **Project:** SME Daily Business Assistant (`SME-Daily-Business`)\n",
    "### **Jira Task:** `KAN-57`\n",
    "### **Models:** Full Evolution Matrix: Base Models, `v1`, `v2`, `v3`, `v4` + ChromaDB RAG\n",
    "### **Hardware:** Google Colab Tesla T4 GPU (15 GB VRAM)\n",
    "\n",
    "---\n",
    "### 🎯 Day 11 Objectives & Sprint Deliverables\n",
    "1. **Full Collection Validation:** Load and evaluate all model iterations (`v1`, `v2`, `v3`, `v4` for both Qwen 2.5-7B and Llama 3 8B).\n",
    "2. **Master Evolution Matrix:** Benchmark metrics (ROUGE-1/2/L, BLEU-4, BERTScore, Latency) across the entire sprint.\n",
    "3. **Publication-Grade Comparison Charts:** Generate progression curves and lift bar charts using `matplotlib` and `seaborn`.\n",
    "4. **Persist Final Report:** Save `day11_final_validation_report.json` and high-res chart images to Google Drive."
   ]
  },
